<p>Increases critical chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10%</acronym> (at all times) and critical strike power by up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 18%, 26%, 33%, 40%</acronym> (based on hate).</p><p></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Anger makes you strong. And you're always angry.</span></span></p>